            "review_text": "Алина\nSochi, Russia178 contributions\n0\nDelicious and inexpensive!\nSep 2026 • Couples\nA very pleasant large Vietnamese restaurant. The food is delicious, the portions are large, everything is prepared with quality and neatness. The menu is diverse, the selection is good, and the prices are very pleasant. Overall, we were very satisfied - delicious, filling, and a comfortable atmosphere. We will gladly come again.\n\nA quite large and very pleasant Vietnamese restaurant. Delicious food, large portions, all dishes are carefully prepared and high quality. Diverse menu, many options and very reasonable prices. Overall, we are very satisfied - the food is delicious, filling, and the space is comfortable. Will definitely come back again.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten September 15, 2026",
